 Microbiol</source><volume>62</volume><fpage>612</fpage><lpage>620</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17076663</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Shaw1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title><italic>Theileria</italic> development and host cell invasion.</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Dobbelaere</surname><given-names>DAE</given-names></name><name><surname>McKeever</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><source><italic>Theileria</italic></source><publisher-loc>Boston</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Kluwer Academic Publishers</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>22</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Dobbelaere1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dobbelaere</surname><given-names>DAE</given-names></name><name><surname>Heussler</surname><given-names>VT</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Transformation of leukocytes by <italic>Theileria parva</italic> and <italic>T. annulata</italic>.</article-title><source>Annu Rev Microbiol</source><volume>53</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10547684</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Heussler1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heussler</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Sturm</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Langsley</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Regulation of host cell survival by intracellular <italic>Plasmodium</italic> and <italic>Theileria</italic> parasites.</article-title><source>Parasitology</source><volume>132</volume><issue>Suppl</issue><fpage>S49</fpage><lpage>60</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17018165</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Dobbelaere2"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dobbelaere</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuenzi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>The strategies of the <italic>Theileria</italic> parasite: a new twist in host-pathogen interactions.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Immunol</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>524</fpage><lpage>530</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15245750</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Dobbelaere3"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dobbelaere</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rottenberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title><italic>Theileria</italic>-induced leukocyte transformation.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Microbiol</source><volume>6</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>382</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12941408</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Shiels1"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shiels</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Langsley</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Weir</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Pain</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>McKellar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Alteration of host cell phenotype by <italic>Theileria annulata</italic> and <italic>Theileria parva</italic>: mining for manipulators in the parasite genomes.</article-title><source>Int J Parasitol</source><volume>36</volume><fpage>9</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16221473</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Heussler2"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heussler</surname><given-names>VT</given-names></name><name><surname>Stanway</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Cellular and molecular interactions between the apicomplexan parasites <italic>Plasmodium</italic> and <italic>Theileria</italic> and their host cells.</article-title><source>Parasite</source><volume>15</volume><fpage>211</fpage><lpage>218</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18814683</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Heussler3"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heussler</surname><given-names>VT</given-names></name><name><surname>Rottenberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwab</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuenzi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Fernandez</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Hijacking of host cell IKK signalosomes by the transforming parasite <italic>Theileria</italic>.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>298</volume><fpage>1033</fpage><lpage>1036</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12411708</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Shiels2"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shiels</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>McKellar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Katzer</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Lyons</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinnaird</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>A <italic>Theileria annulata</italic> DNA binding protein localized to the host cell nucleus alters the phenotype of a bovine macrophage cell line.</article-title><source>Eukaryot Cell</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>495</fpage><lpage>505</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15075278</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Swan1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Swan</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Stern</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>McKellar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillips</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Oura</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Characterisation of a cluster of genes encoding <italic>Theileria annulata</italic> AT hook DNA-binding proteins and evidence for localisation to the host cell nucleus.</article-title><source>J Cell Sci</source><volume>114</volume><fpage>2747</fpage><lpage>2754</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11683409</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-Ravindran1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ravindran</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Boothroyd</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Secretion of proteins into host cells by Apicomplexan parasites.</article-title><source>Traffic</source><volume>9</volume><fpage>647</fpage><lpage>656</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18266908</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004839-McKeever1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McKeever</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Morrison</surname><given-names>WI</given-names></name></person-group><year>1994</year><article-title>Immunity to a parasite that transforms T lymphocytes.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Im